    "The extraction's statement that footnote 1 is not supplied is stale: db43e253bea18.u27.7511 supplies it. The referenced Handbook section 6.4 itself is not supplied.",
    "Paragraph 3's services are described in db43e253bea18.u3.792. The descriptive marketing claim creates neither a duty to identify returns nor an automatic gift classification.",
    "The external text of Code of Conduct paragraph 3.11 and the answer to question 1 of the SFC's 30 September 2010 FAQ are absent. They are identifiable authorities for further gift-control interpretation, but no external dependency IDs are supplied.",
